  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Nature sphere (three or more packages).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may read and use an alchemist’s formulae book, creating extracts for use during the day as an alchemist does. You must have a caster level with the entire Nature sphere equal to 3x the level of the extract, and use your Nature caster level as your caster level for the extracts. You must spend 1 spell point per level of the created extract, and only you can drink the extract to gain its effects.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/nature#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
